  "body": "Record the actual November 23 publication and issue-closeout evidence, and correct W47's latency display for a delayed supplement. The Nov 18 page first published a zero-paper bulletin; using that original page timestamp for papers added on Nov 23 understated their publication delay. W47 now leaves the latency median unknown and explains why. The old value and original timestamp remain archived; paper numbers and review dates are unchanged.\n\nThe initial #153 deployment succeeded and 40 public responses matched reviewed bytes. Its CI log confirms 434 passing tests. The 9,292-ID ledger adds live receipts for 29 inclusions and two corrected v2 cards while preserving historical version tasks. Issues #115, #116 and #144 are closed; six older evidence issues and three new deferrals remain itemized. Zero paid generation requests/tokens were made; raw balances remain private.\n\nValidation: repository validation and the archive-path guard pass; generated output is committed. The earlier live receipt remains explicitly bound to #153. The changed W47 metric will receive a fresh Pages and public-byte receipt after this PR merges.\n",
